window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b236-52dcb077fe1ea311.json"]={sha256:"52dcb077fe1ea311b812963310d72081a94fc7ed5f4d699511d3fd599a7aa454",value:{"id":"b236","title":"瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工","titleEn":"Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課以瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工為入口，深入瀝青心牆的溫度依存、孔隙控制與界面變形。十個單元各自對應不同的荷載路徑、能量交換或監測問題，從守恆式建立量化估算，再檢查量測配置是否能辨認真正失效原因。工程史實只採用列明範圍的公開一手資料；所有模型輸入另標為教學假設，成果是可追溯的工程判讀紀錄。","summaryEn":"Using Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction as its entry point, this course examines temperature dependence, void control and interface deformation in asphalt cores. Ten units address different load paths, energy exchanges or monitoring questions, starting with conservation-based estimates and testing whether observations distinguish failure causes. Historical statements use scoped primary evidence. Numerical model inputs are separately identified as teaching assumptions, producing a traceable engineering interpretation record.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-systems","subcategoryTitle":"防潮、航運與大壩施工","subcategoryTitleEn":"Tidal barriers, navigation and dam construction","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-systems","learningTags":["water","water-systems","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-dam","architectureNodes":[["膠結料比例基準","Binder proportion basis"],["黏彈遲滯與載重時間","Viscoelastic lag and loading time"],["薄層供料與寬度","Lift supply and core width"],["趾板接觸與有效壓力","Plinth contact and effective pressure"],["材料老化與保留試樣","Material ageing and retained specimens"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-dam","labels":["膠結料比例基準","黏彈遲滯與載重時間","薄層供料與寬度","趾板接觸與有效壓力","材料老化與保留試樣"],"labelsEn":["Binder proportion basis","Viscoelastic lag and loading time","Lift supply and core width","Plinth contact and effective pressure","Material ageing and retained specimens"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設理論最大密度2500 kg/m³、實測體積密度2450 kg/m³，空隙率1−2450/2500=2%；非任何專案接受上限。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。 空隙率敏感度固定理論最大密度2500 kg/m³，只將體積密度2450提高至2475 kg/m³。空隙率100(1−ρb/ρmax)由2%降至1%，是降低1個百分點而非降低1%。比較假定材料組成和測定方法不變；它不設定施工壓實目標，也未據此證明瀝青心牆的抗滲或低溫變形性能。","textEn":"This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material. Content is six percent of mineral mass but 5.6604 percent of total mass, a denominator conversion rather than a recommended mix. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume theoretical maximum density 2500 kg/m³ and measured bulk density 2450 kg/m³. Air void content is two percent, not a project acceptance limit. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters. Hold theoretical maximum density at 2500 kg/m³ and change only bulk density from 2450 to 2475 kg/m³. Air-void content 100(1−ρb/ρmax) drops from 2% to 1%, one percentage point rather than a 1% relative decrease. Composition and measurement method remain fixed. This comparison neither sets a compaction target nor establishes permeability or cold-temperature deformation performance.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b236-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「膠結料比例基準」與「體積孔隙與連通性」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Binder proportion basis\" and \"Air voids and connectivity\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b236-v15-01","title":"膠結料比例基準：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Binder proportion basis: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「膠結料比例基準」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Binder proportion basis” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"瀝青含量可按礦料重量或混合料總重量表示，兩種百分比不能直接比較。配方必須先確認分母，再連結骨材表面覆蓋與孔隙填充，不能把道路配方直接移植到壩心牆。 假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。 把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。即使含量相同，不同骨材形狀和細粉也會改變工作性與體積孔隙。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「膠結料比例基準」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Bitumen content may use mineral mass or total mixture mass as denominator, making the percentages noninterchangeable. Mixture interpretation must establish the basis before relating coating and void filling, rather than copying road asphalt into dam cores. Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material. Content is six percent of mineral mass but 5.6604 percent of total mass, a denominator conversion rather than a recommended mix. Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it. Equal content also does not ensure equal workability or voids for different aggregates. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Binder proportion basis” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material.","failure":"常見誤解：「按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「膠結料比例基準」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Binder proportion basis”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-01-k1","title":"膠結料比例基準","titleEn":"Binder proportion basis","text":"瀝青含量可按礦料重量或混合料總重量表示，兩種百分比不能直接比較。配方必須先確認分母，再連結骨材表面覆蓋與孔隙填充，不能把道路配方直接移植到壩心牆。","textEn":"Bitumen content may use mineral mass or total mixture mass as denominator, making the percentages noninterchangeable. Mixture interpretation must establish the basis before relating coating and void filling, rather than copying road asphalt into dam cores.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「膠結料比例基準」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Binder proportion basis\" is correct?","options":["按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。","瀝青含量可按礦料重量或混合料總重量表示，兩種百分比不能直接比較。","總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。"],"optionsEn":["Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical.","Bitumen content may use mineral mass or total mixture mass as denominator, making the percentages noninterchangeable.","Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core."],"answer":1,"explanation":"瀝青含量可按礦料重量或混合料總重量表示，兩種百分比不能直接比較。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Bitumen content may use mineral mass or total mixture mass as denominator, making the percentages noninterchangeable. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b236-v15-02","title":"膠結料比例基準：定量估算","titleEn":"Binder proportion basis: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「膠結料比例基準」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Binder proportion basis” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material. Content is six percent of mineral mass but 5.6604 percent of total mass, a denominator conversion rather than a recommended mix. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對拌合紀錄、萃取試驗和報表的分母定義，用同一批樣品重算兩種比例；另查含水或細粉是否計入礦料重量，將配方版本和批次標籤一併保存以便追溯。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check denominator definitions in batch records, extraction tests and reports and recalculate both fractions for one sample.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material. Content is six percent of mineral mass but 5.6604 percent of total mass, a denominator conversion rather than a recommended mix.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「膠結料比例基準」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Binder proportion basis\", which statement holds?","options":["自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。","瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。"],"optionsEn":["Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection.","Ductile asphalt material guarantees complete bonding at every construction interface.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b236-v15-03","title":"膠結料比例基準：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Binder proportion basis: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「膠結料比例基準」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Binder proportion basis” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對拌合紀錄、萃取試驗和報表的分母定義，用同一批樣品重算兩種比例；另查含水或細粉是否計入礦料重量，將配方版本和批次標籤一併保存以便追溯。核對空容器皮重。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check denominator definitions in batch records, extraction tests and reports and recalculate both fractions for one sample. Verify moisture and filler treatment, retaining mixture versions and batch labels for traceability and consistent comparison. Verify empty-container tare independently. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以膠結料比例基準編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對拌合紀錄、萃取試驗和報表的分母定義，用同一批樣品重算兩種比例；另查含水或細粉是否計入礦料重量，將配方版本和批次標籤一併保存以便追溯。核對空容器皮重。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for binder proportion basis, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check denominator definitions in batch records, extraction tests and reports and recalculate both fractions for one sample. Verify moisture and filler treatment, retaining mixture versions and batch labels for traceability and consistent comparison. Verify empty-container tare independently.","failure":"注意干擾：把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對拌合紀錄、萃取試驗和報表的分母定義，用同一批樣品重算兩種比例；另查含水或細粉是否計入礦料重量，將配方版本和批次標籤一併保存以便追溯。核對空容器皮重。","textEn":"Check denominator definitions in batch records, extraction tests and reports and recalculate both fractions for one sample. Verify moisture and filler treatment, retaining mixture versions and batch labels for traceability and consistent comparison. Verify empty-container tare independently.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以膠結料比例基準編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對拌合紀錄、萃取試驗和報表的分母定義，用同一批樣品重算兩種比例；另查含水或細粉是否計入礦料重量，將配方版本和批次標籤一併保存以便追溯。核對空容器皮重。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for binder proportion basis, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check denominator definitions in batch records, extraction tests and reports and recalculate both fractions for one sample. Verify moisture and filler treatment, retaining mixture versions and batch labels for traceability and consistent comparison. Verify empty-container tare independently.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「膠結料比例基準」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Binder proportion basis\"?","options":["核對拌合紀錄、萃取試驗和報表的分母定義，用同一批樣品重算兩種比例；另查含水或細粉是否計入礦料重量，將配方版本和批次標籤一併保存以便追溯。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。"],"optionsEn":["Check denominator definitions in batch records, extraction tests and reports and recalculate both fractions for one sample.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain."],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對拌合紀錄、萃取試驗和報表的分母定義，用同一批樣品重算兩種比例；另查含水或細粉是否計入礦料重量，將配方版本和批次標籤一併保存以便追溯。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check denominator definitions in batch records, extraction tests and reports and recalculate both fractions for one sample. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b236-v15-04","title":"膠結料比例基準：失效診斷","titleEn":"Binder proportion basis: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「膠結料比例基準」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Binder proportion basis” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。即使含量相同，不同骨材形狀和細粉也會改變工作性與體積孔隙。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it. Equal content also does not ensure equal workability or voids for different aggregates. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：即使含量相同，不同骨材形狀和細粉也會改變工作性與體積孔隙。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Equal content also does not ensure equal workability or voids for different aggregates.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。即使含量相同，不同骨材形狀和細粉也會改變工作性與體積孔隙。","textEn":"Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it. Equal content also does not ensure equal workability or voids for different aggregates.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「膠結料比例基準」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Binder proportion basis\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。","總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it.","Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b236-v15-05","title":"體積孔隙與連通性：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Air voids and connectivity: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「體積孔隙與連通性」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Air voids and connectivity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"低孔隙是防滲的重要條件，但總孔隙量不等於連通孔隙量。密度法可檢查壓實狀態，仍須用滲透和界面檢驗排除連續缺陷。 假設理論最大密度2500 kg/m³、實測體積密度2450 kg/m³，空隙率1−2450/2500=2%；非任何專案接受上限。 少量連通孔隙可能比較多封閉孔隙更影響漏流，取芯損傷又可能製造人工裂縫。只看空隙百分比，無法分辨施工缺陷與取樣過程造成的通道。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「體積孔隙與連通性」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Low void content supports impermeability, but total void volume differs from connected voids. Density checks compaction while permeability and interface evidence remain necessary to exclude continuous defects. Assume theoretical maximum density 2500 kg/m³ and measured bulk density 2450 kg/m³. Air void content is two percent, not a project acceptance limit. A small connected void fraction can transmit more flow than many isolated voids, and coring damage can create artificial cracks. Void percentage alone cannot distinguish construction defects from sampling-induced pathways. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Air voids and connectivity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設理論最大密度2500 kg/m³、實測體積密度2450 kg/m³，空隙率1−2450/2500=2%；非任何專案接受上限。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume theoretical maximum density 2500 kg/m³ and measured bulk density 2450 kg/m³.","failure":"常見誤解：「總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「體積孔隙與連通性」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Air voids and connectivity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-05-k1","title":"體積孔隙與連通性","titleEn":"Air voids and connectivity","text":"低孔隙是防滲的重要條件，但總孔隙量不等於連通孔隙量。密度法可檢查壓實狀態，仍須用滲透和界面檢驗排除連續缺陷。","textEn":"Low void content supports impermeability, but total void volume differs from connected voids. Density checks compaction while permeability and interface evidence remain necessary to exclude continuous defects.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「體積孔隙與連通性」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Air voids and connectivity\" is correct?","options":["總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。","短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。","低孔隙是防滲的重要條件，但總孔隙量不等於連通孔隙量。"],"optionsEn":["Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core.","A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions.","Low void content supports impermeability, but total void volume differs from connected voids."],"answer":2,"explanation":"低孔隙是防滲的重要條件，但總孔隙量不等於連通孔隙量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Low void content supports impermeability, but total void volume differs from connected voids. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b236-v15-06","title":"體積孔隙與連通性：定量估算","titleEn":"Air voids and connectivity: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「體積孔隙與連通性」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Air voids and connectivity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設理論最大密度2500 kg/m³、實測體積密度2450 kg/m³，空隙率1−2450/2500=2%；非任何專案接受上限。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume theoretical maximum density 2500 kg/m³ and measured bulk density 2450 kg/m³. Air void content is two percent, not a project acceptance limit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對同配比樣品核對理論與實測密度，記錄取芯位置、溫度和體積量法；將滲透試驗與孔隙影像配對，檢查局部層間缺陷是否被全試體平均密度掩蓋。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check theoretical and measured densities for the same mixture, recording core position, temperature and volume method.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設理論最大密度2500 kg/m³、實測體積密度2450 kg/m³，空隙率1−2450/2500=2%；非任何專案接受上限。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume theoretical maximum density 2500 kg/m³ and measured bulk density 2450 kg/m³. Air void content is two percent, not a project acceptance limit.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「體積孔隙與連通性」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Air voids and connectivity\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設理論最大密度2500 kg/m³、實測體積密度2450 kg/m³，空隙率1−2450/2500=2%。","其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。","只要平均接觸壓力大於水壓，接頭就不可能存在漏流。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume theoretical maximum density 2500 kg/m³ and measured bulk density 2450 kg/m³.","Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width.","Mean contact pressure above water pressure makes leakage through the connection impossible."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設理論最大密度2500 kg/m³、實測體積密度2450 kg/m³，空隙率1−2450/2500=2%；非任何專案接受上限。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume theoretical maximum density 2500 kg/m³ and measured bulk density 2450 kg/m³. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b236-v15-07","title":"體積孔隙與連通性：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Air voids and connectivity: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「體積孔隙與連通性」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Air voids and connectivity” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對同配比樣品核對理論與實測密度，記錄取芯位置、溫度和體積量法；將滲透試驗與孔隙影像配對，檢查局部層間缺陷是否被全試體平均密度掩蓋。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check theoretical and measured densities for the same mixture, recording core position, temperature and volume method. Pair permeability tests with void imaging and determine whether whole-specimen density conceals a local interlift defect or connected path. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以體積孔隙與連通性編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。對同配比樣品核對理論與實測密度，記錄取芯位置、溫度和體積量法；將滲透試驗與孔隙影像配對，檢查局部層間缺陷是否被全試體平均密度掩蓋。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for air voids and connectivity, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check theoretical and measured densities for the same mixture, recording core position, temperature and volume method. Pair permeability tests with void imaging and determine whether whole-specimen density conceals a local interlift defect or connected path.","failure":"注意干擾：少量連通孔隙可能比較多封閉孔隙更影響漏流，取芯損傷又可能製造人工裂縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A small connected void fraction can transmit more flow than many isolated voids, and coring damage can create artificial cracks. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對同配比樣品核對理論與實測密度，記錄取芯位置、溫度和體積量法；將滲透試驗與孔隙影像配對，檢查局部層間缺陷是否被全試體平均密度掩蓋。","textEn":"Check theoretical and measured densities for the same mixture, recording core position, temperature and volume method. Pair permeability tests with void imaging and determine whether whole-specimen density conceals a local interlift defect or connected path.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以體積孔隙與連通性編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。對同配比樣品核對理論與實測密度，記錄取芯位置、溫度和體積量法；將滲透試驗與孔隙影像配對，檢查局部層間缺陷是否被全試體平均密度掩蓋。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for air voids and connectivity, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check theoretical and measured densities for the same mixture, recording core position, temperature and volume method. Pair permeability tests with void imaging and determine whether whole-specimen density conceals a local interlift defect or connected path.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「體積孔隙與連通性」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Air voids and connectivity\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","對同配比樣品核對理論與實測密度，記錄取芯位置、溫度和體積量法；將滲透試驗與孔隙影像配對，檢查局部層間缺陷是否被全試體平均密度掩蓋。","連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Check theoretical and measured densities for the same mixture, recording core position, temperature and volume method.","Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free."],"answer":1,"explanation":"對同配比樣品核對理論與實測密度，記錄取芯位置、溫度和體積量法；將滲透試驗與孔隙影像配對，檢查局部層間缺陷是否被全試體平均密度掩蓋。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check theoretical and measured densities for the same mixture, recording core position, temperature and volume method. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b236-v15-08","title":"體積孔隙與連通性：失效診斷","titleEn":"Air voids and connectivity: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「體積孔隙與連通性」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Air voids and connectivity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"少量連通孔隙可能比較多封閉孔隙更影響漏流，取芯損傷又可能製造人工裂縫。只看空隙百分比，無法分辨施工缺陷與取樣過程造成的通道。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A small connected void fraction can transmit more flow than many isolated voids, and coring damage can create artificial cracks. Void percentage alone cannot distinguish construction defects from sampling-induced pathways. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：只看空隙百分比，無法分辨施工缺陷與取樣過程造成的通道。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Void percentage alone cannot distinguish construction defects from sampling-induced pathways.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"少量連通孔隙可能比較多封閉孔隙更影響漏流，取芯損傷又可能製造人工裂縫。只看空隙百分比，無法分辨施工缺陷與取樣過程造成的通道。","textEn":"A small connected void fraction can transmit more flow than many isolated voids, and coring damage can create artificial cracks. Void percentage alone cannot distinguish construction defects from sampling-induced pathways.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「體積孔隙與連通性」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Air voids and connectivity\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。","少量連通孔隙可能比較多封閉孔隙更影響漏流，取芯損傷又可能製造人工裂縫。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions.","A small connected void fraction can transmit more flow than many isolated voids, and coring damage can create artificial cracks."],"answer":2,"explanation":"少量連通孔隙可能比較多封閉孔隙更影響漏流，取芯損傷又可能製造人工裂縫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A small connected void fraction can transmit more flow than many isolated voids, and coring damage can create artificial cracks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b236-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」與「熱收縮與相鄰材料」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Viscoelastic lag and loading time\" and \"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b236-v15-09","title":"黏彈遲滯與載重時間：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Viscoelastic lag and loading time: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Viscoelastic lag and loading time” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"瀝青混凝土的應變會隨載重時間與溫度發展，短時剛度不能直接代表長期變形。黏彈類比適合說明延遲反應，參數需由對應溫度和應力範圍試驗取得。 假設Kelvin-Voigt模型E=100 MPa、η=10⁹ Pa·s、恆應力0.1 MPa，時間常數10 s，t=20 s應變0.0008647；純教學小應變。 單一黏彈元件無法描述所有塑性與損傷，卸載殘餘應變可能超出模型。若把一個溫度下的模數永久固定，會錯估施工熱態與服役冷態的差異。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Asphalt-concrete strain develops with loading duration and temperature, so short-term stiffness does not represent long-term movement. A viscoelastic analogy illustrates delayed response but needs parameters tested at relevant temperatures and stresses. Assume Kelvin-Voigt E=100 MPa, η=10⁹ Pa·s and constant stress 0.1 MPa. Time constant is ten seconds and strain at twenty seconds is 0.0008647, a small-strain teaching model. One viscoelastic element cannot describe every plastic or damage mechanism, and residual strain may exceed it. Fixing modulus from one temperature misrepresents differences between warm construction and cool service conditions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Viscoelastic lag and loading time” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設Kelvin-Voigt模型E=100 MPa、η=10⁹ Pa·s、恆應力0.1 MPa，時間常數10 s，t=20 s應變0.0008647；純教學小應變。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume Kelvin-Voigt E=100 MPa, η=10⁹ Pa·s and constant stress 0.1 MPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Viscoelastic lag and loading time”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-09-k1","title":"黏彈遲滯與載重時間","titleEn":"Viscoelastic lag and loading time","text":"瀝青混凝土的應變會隨載重時間與溫度發展，短時剛度不能直接代表長期變形。黏彈類比適合說明延遲反應，參數需由對應溫度和應力範圍試驗取得。","textEn":"Asphalt-concrete strain develops with loading duration and temperature, so short-term stiffness does not represent long-term movement. A viscoelastic analogy illustrates delayed response but needs parameters tested at relevant temperatures and stresses.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Viscoelastic lag and loading time\" is correct?","options":["瀝青混凝土的應變會隨載重時間與溫度發展，短時剛度不能直接代表長期變形。","短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。","自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。"],"optionsEn":["Asphalt-concrete strain develops with loading duration and temperature, so short-term stiffness does not represent long-term movement.","A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions.","Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"瀝青混凝土的應變會隨載重時間與溫度發展，短時剛度不能直接代表長期變形。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Asphalt-concrete strain develops with loading duration and temperature, so short-term stiffness does not represent long-term movement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b236-v15-10","title":"黏彈遲滯與載重時間：定量估算","titleEn":"Viscoelastic lag and loading time: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Viscoelastic lag and loading time” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設Kelvin-Voigt模型E=100 MPa、η=10⁹ Pa·s、恆應力0.1 MPa，時間常數10 s，t=20 s應變0.0008647；純教學小應變。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume Kelvin-Voigt E=100 MPa, η=10⁹ Pa·s and constant stress 0.1 MPa. Time constant is ten seconds and strain at twenty seconds is 0.0008647, a small-strain teaching model. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設Kelvin-Voigt模型E=100 MPa、η=10⁹ Pa·s、恆應力0.1 MPa，時間常數10 s，t=20 s應變0.0008647；純教學小應變。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume Kelvin-Voigt E=100 MPa, η=10⁹ Pa·s and constant stress 0.1 MPa. Time constant is ten seconds and strain at twenty seconds is 0.0008647, a small-strain teaching model.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Viscoelastic lag and loading time\", which statement holds?","options":["瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設Kelvin-Voigt模型E=100 MPa、η=10⁹ Pa·s、恆應力0.1 MPa，時間常數10 s，t=20 s應變0.0008647。","相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。"],"optionsEn":["Ductile asphalt material guarantees complete bonding at every construction interface.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume Kelvin-Voigt E=100 MPa, η=10⁹ Pa·s and constant stress 0.1 MPa.","Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設Kelvin-Voigt模型E=100 MPa、η=10⁹ Pa·s、恆應力0.1 MPa，時間常數10 s，t=20 s應變0.0008647；純教學小應變。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume Kelvin-Voigt E=100 MPa, η=10⁹ Pa·s and constant stress 0.1 MPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b236-v15-11","title":"黏彈遲滯與載重時間：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Viscoelastic lag and loading time: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Viscoelastic lag and loading time” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。再查卸載回復曲線。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both. Record temperature, strain rate and confinement beside parameters, then validate against a loading history excluded from calibration. Also compare recovery after removing the load. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以黏彈遲滯與載重時間編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。再查卸載回復曲線。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for viscoelastic lag and loading time, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both. Record temperature, strain rate and confinement beside parameters, then validate against a loading history excluded from calibration. Also compare recovery after removing the load.","failure":"注意干擾：單一黏彈元件無法描述所有塑性與損傷，卸載殘餘應變可能超出模型。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: One viscoelastic element cannot describe every plastic or damage mechanism, and residual strain may exceed it. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。再查卸載回復曲線。","textEn":"Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both. Record temperature, strain rate and confinement beside parameters, then validate against a loading history excluded from calibration. Also compare recovery after removing the load.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以黏彈遲滯與載重時間編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。再查卸載回復曲線。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for viscoelastic lag and loading time, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both. Record temperature, strain rate and confinement beside parameters, then validate against a loading history excluded from calibration. Also compare recovery after removing the load.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Viscoelastic lag and loading time\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","老化後模數提高就表示心牆密封能力與延性必定一起提高。","以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","An ageing-related modulus increase necessarily improves both core sealing and ductility.","Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b236-v15-12","title":"黏彈遲滯與載重時間：失效診斷","titleEn":"Viscoelastic lag and loading time: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Viscoelastic lag and loading time” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"單一黏彈元件無法描述所有塑性與損傷，卸載殘餘應變可能超出模型。若把一個溫度下的模數永久固定，會錯估施工熱態與服役冷態的差異。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"One viscoelastic element cannot describe every plastic or damage mechanism, and residual strain may exceed it. Fixing modulus from one temperature misrepresents differences between warm construction and cool service conditions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若把一個溫度下的模數永久固定，會錯估施工熱態與服役冷態的差異。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Fixing modulus from one temperature misrepresents differences between warm construction and cool service conditions.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"單一黏彈元件無法描述所有塑性與損傷，卸載殘餘應變可能超出模型。若把一個溫度下的模數永久固定，會錯估施工熱態與服役冷態的差異。","textEn":"One viscoelastic element cannot describe every plastic or damage mechanism, and residual strain may exceed it. Fixing modulus from one temperature misrepresents differences between warm construction and cool service conditions.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Viscoelastic lag and loading time\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["單一黏彈元件無法描述所有塑性與損傷，卸載殘餘應變可能超出模型。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。"],"optionsEn":["One viscoelastic element cannot describe every plastic or damage mechanism, and residual strain may exceed it.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"單一黏彈元件無法描述所有塑性與損傷，卸載殘餘應變可能超出模型。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"One viscoelastic element cannot describe every plastic or damage mechanism, and residual strain may exceed it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b236-v15-13","title":"熱收縮與相鄰材料：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「熱收縮與相鄰材料」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Thermal contraction and neighboring materials” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"瀝青心牆冷卻時會收縮，而兩側過渡料限制其自由變形。變形相容與黏結同樣重要，不能只看心牆材料自身能承受多大拉應變。 假設有效長10 m、熱膨脹係數15×10⁻⁶/K、降溫20 K，自由收縮3 mm；材料係數為假設，不含黏彈鬆弛與拘束。 局部快速冷卻可能產生集中拉伸，而高溫黏性又會讓應力鬆弛。若直接用彈性拘束公式跨越整個溫度範圍，可能誇大或低估真正的接縫需求。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「熱收縮與相鄰材料」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Cooling contracts the asphalt core while transition material restrains free movement. Compatibility and bonding matter alongside the material tensile strain capacity, especially where geometry changes or the core meets concrete. Assume length 10 m, expansion coefficient 15×10⁻⁶/K and cooling twenty kelvin. Free contraction is 3 mm, with assumed coefficient and no viscoelastic relaxation or restraint. Local rapid cooling concentrates tension, while warm viscous behavior relaxes stress. Applying one elastic restraint formula across the whole temperature range can either exaggerate or understate actual joint demand. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Thermal contraction and neighboring materials” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效長10 m、熱膨脹係數15×10⁻⁶/K、降溫20 K，自由收縮3 mm；材料係數為假設，不含黏彈鬆弛與拘束。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume length 10 m, expansion coefficient 15×10⁻⁶/K and cooling twenty kelvin.","failure":"常見誤解：「自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「熱收縮與相鄰材料」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Thermal contraction and neighboring materials”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-13-k1","title":"熱收縮與相鄰材料","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials","text":"瀝青心牆冷卻時會收縮，而兩側過渡料限制其自由變形。變形相容與黏結同樣重要，不能只看心牆材料自身能承受多大拉應變。","textEn":"Cooling contracts the asphalt core while transition material restrains free movement. Compatibility and bonding matter alongside the material tensile strain capacity, especially where geometry changes or the core meets concrete.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「熱收縮與相鄰材料」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials\" is correct?","options":["自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。","瀝青心牆冷卻時會收縮，而兩側過渡料限制其自由變形。","其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。"],"optionsEn":["Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection.","Cooling contracts the asphalt core while transition material restrains free movement.","Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width."],"answer":1,"explanation":"瀝青心牆冷卻時會收縮，而兩側過渡料限制其自由變形。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Cooling contracts the asphalt core while transition material restrains free movement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b236-v15-14","title":"熱收縮與相鄰材料：定量估算","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「熱收縮與相鄰材料」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Thermal contraction and neighboring materials” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效長10 m、熱膨脹係數15×10⁻⁶/K、降溫20 K，自由收縮3 mm；材料係數為假設，不含黏彈鬆弛與拘束。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume length 10 m, expansion coefficient 15×10⁻⁶/K and cooling twenty kelvin. Free contraction is 3 mm, with assumed coefficient and no viscoelastic relaxation or restraint. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步記錄心牆與過渡料溫度和位移，以同時刻差值檢查相容；核對混合料熱性質試驗，再比較趾板接頭附近與壩中央區域的變形，確認自由收縮並未誤當實際張開。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record core and transition temperatures and movements together and assess compatibility at matching times.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效長10 m、熱膨脹係數15×10⁻⁶/K、降溫20 K，自由收縮3 mm；材料係數為假設，不含黏彈鬆弛與拘束。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume length 10 m, expansion coefficient 15×10⁻⁶/K and cooling twenty kelvin. Free contraction is 3 mm, with assumed coefficient and no viscoelastic relaxation or restraint.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「熱收縮與相鄰材料」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials\", which statement holds?","options":["只要平均接觸壓力大於水壓，接頭就不可能存在漏流。","連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效長10 m、熱膨脹係數15×10⁻⁶/K、降溫20 K，自由收縮3 mm；材料係數為假設，不含黏彈鬆弛與拘束。"],"optionsEn":["Mean contact pressure above water pressure makes leakage through the connection impossible.","Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume length 10 m, expansion coefficient 15×10⁻⁶/K and cooling twenty kelvin."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效長10 m、熱膨脹係數15×10⁻⁶/K、降溫20 K，自由收縮3 mm；材料係數為假設，不含黏彈鬆弛與拘束。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume length 10 m, expansion coefficient 15×10⁻⁶/K and cooling twenty kelvin. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b236-v15-15","title":"熱收縮與相鄰材料：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「熱收縮與相鄰材料」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Thermal contraction and neighboring materials” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步記錄心牆與過渡料溫度和位移，以同時刻差值檢查相容；核對混合料熱性質試驗，再比較趾板接頭附近與壩中央區域的變形，確認自由收縮並未誤當實際張開。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record core and transition temperatures and movements together and assess compatibility at matching times. Check mixture thermal tests and compare plinth-adjacent and central zones, ensuring free contraction is not mistaken for actual joint opening. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以熱收縮與相鄰材料編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步記錄心牆與過渡料溫度和位移，以同時刻差值檢查相容；核對混合料熱性質試驗，再比較趾板接頭附近與壩中央區域的變形，確認自由收縮並未誤當實際張開。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for thermal contraction and neighboring materials, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record core and transition temperatures and movements together and assess compatibility at matching times. Check mixture thermal tests and compare plinth-adjacent and central zones, ensuring free contraction is not mistaken for actual joint opening.","failure":"注意干擾：局部快速冷卻可能產生集中拉伸，而高溫黏性又會讓應力鬆弛。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Local rapid cooling concentrates tension, while warm viscous behavior relaxes stress. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步記錄心牆與過渡料溫度和位移，以同時刻差值檢查相容；核對混合料熱性質試驗，再比較趾板接頭附近與壩中央區域的變形，確認自由收縮並未誤當實際張開。","textEn":"Record core and transition temperatures and movements together and assess compatibility at matching times. Check mixture thermal tests and compare plinth-adjacent and central zones, ensuring free contraction is not mistaken for actual joint opening.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以熱收縮與相鄰材料編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步記錄心牆與過渡料溫度和位移，以同時刻差值檢查相容；核對混合料熱性質試驗，再比較趾板接頭附近與壩中央區域的變形，確認自由收縮並未誤當實際張開。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for thermal contraction and neighboring materials, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record core and transition temperatures and movements together and assess compatibility at matching times. Check mixture thermal tests and compare plinth-adjacent and central zones, ensuring free contraction is not mistaken for actual joint opening.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「熱收縮與相鄰材料」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials\"?","options":["同步記錄心牆與過渡料溫度和位移，以同時刻差值檢查相容；核對混合料熱性質試驗，再比較趾板接頭附近與壩中央區域的變形，確認自由收縮並未誤當實際張開。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["Record core and transition temperatures and movements together and assess compatibility at matching times.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同步記錄心牆與過渡料溫度和位移，以同時刻差值檢查相容；核對混合料熱性質試驗，再比較趾板接頭附近與壩中央區域的變形，確認自由收縮並未誤當實際張開。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record core and transition temperatures and movements together and assess compatibility at matching times. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b236-v15-16","title":"熱收縮與相鄰材料：失效診斷","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「熱收縮與相鄰材料」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Thermal contraction and neighboring materials” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"局部快速冷卻可能產生集中拉伸，而高溫黏性又會讓應力鬆弛。若直接用彈性拘束公式跨越整個溫度範圍，可能誇大或低估真正的接縫需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Local rapid cooling concentrates tension, while warm viscous behavior relaxes stress. Applying one elastic restraint formula across the whole temperature range can either exaggerate or understate actual joint demand. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若直接用彈性拘束公式跨越整個溫度範圍，可能誇大或低估真正的接縫需求。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Applying one elastic restraint formula across the whole temperature range can either exaggerate or understate actual joint demand.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"局部快速冷卻可能產生集中拉伸，而高溫黏性又會讓應力鬆弛。若直接用彈性拘束公式跨越整個溫度範圍，可能誇大或低估真正的接縫需求。","textEn":"Local rapid cooling concentrates tension, while warm viscous behavior relaxes stress. Applying one elastic restraint formula across the whole temperature range can either exaggerate or understate actual joint demand.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「熱收縮與相鄰材料」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","局部快速冷卻可能產生集中拉伸，而高溫黏性又會讓應力鬆弛。","其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Local rapid cooling concentrates tension, while warm viscous behavior relaxes stress.","Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width."],"answer":1,"explanation":"局部快速冷卻可能產生集中拉伸，而高溫黏性又會讓應力鬆弛。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Local rapid cooling concentrates tension, while warm viscous behavior relaxes stress. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b236-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「薄層供料與寬度」與「層間黏結與剪切」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Lift supply and core width\" and \"Interlift bond and shear\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b236-v15-17","title":"薄層供料與寬度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Lift supply and core width: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「薄層供料與寬度」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Lift supply and core width” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"心牆體積遠小於壩殼，但必須與過渡區同步上升，否則缺乏側向支承或造成施工等待。寬度連續性比每日總方量更能反映防滲屏障是否完整。 假設一層長200 m、寬0.6 m、厚0.25 m，材料體積30 m³；若寬度局部少0.05 m持續20 m，缺量0.25 m³，不能靠別處超寬抵銷。 材料側向擠入過渡料可使表面寬度看似足夠但有效核心變薄，局部冷料團也會破壞連續性。把整層平均寬度當最小厚度，會漏掉控制滲流的窄點。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「薄層供料與寬度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Core volume is small relative to the shells but must rise compatibly with transitions to preserve support and avoid waiting. Width continuity reveals sealing integrity better than daily total material output alone. Assume lift length 200 m, width 0.6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 30 m³. A 0.05 m width deficit over 20 m loses 0.25 m³ and is not offset by excess elsewhere. Lateral intrusion into transition material can mask a thinner effective core, while cold clumps disrupt continuity. Treating mean width as minimum thickness misses narrow sections controlling seepage performance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Lift supply and core width” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層長200 m、寬0.6 m、厚0.25 m，材料體積30 m³；若寬度局部少0.05 m持續20 m，缺量0.25 m³，不能靠別處超寬抵銷。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume lift length 200 m, width 0.6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 30 m³.","failure":"常見誤解：「其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「薄層供料與寬度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Lift supply and core width”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-17-k1","title":"薄層供料與寬度","titleEn":"Lift supply and core width","text":"心牆體積遠小於壩殼，但必須與過渡區同步上升，否則缺乏側向支承或造成施工等待。寬度連續性比每日總方量更能反映防滲屏障是否完整。","textEn":"Core volume is small relative to the shells but must rise compatibly with transitions to preserve support and avoid waiting. Width continuity reveals sealing integrity better than daily total material output alone.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「薄層供料與寬度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Lift supply and core width\" is correct?","options":["其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。","瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。","心牆體積遠小於壩殼，但必須與過渡區同步上升，否則缺乏側向支承或造成施工等待。"],"optionsEn":["Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width.","Ductile asphalt material guarantees complete bonding at every construction interface.","Core volume is small relative to the shells but must rise compatibly with transitions to preserve support and avoid waiting."],"answer":2,"explanation":"心牆體積遠小於壩殼，但必須與過渡區同步上升，否則缺乏側向支承或造成施工等待。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Core volume is small relative to the shells but must rise compatibly with transitions to preserve support and avoid waiting. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b236-v15-18","title":"薄層供料與寬度：定量估算","titleEn":"Lift supply and core width: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「薄層供料與寬度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Lift supply and core width” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層長200 m、寬0.6 m、厚0.25 m，材料體積30 m³；若寬度局部少0.05 m持續20 m，缺量0.25 m³，不能靠別處超寬抵銷。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume lift length 200 m, width 0.6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 30 m³. A 0.05 m width deficit over 20 m loses 0.25 m³ and is not offset by excess elsewhere. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：逐段量測壓實後心牆寬度與中心線，將進料和過渡區高度對照；用位置化方量查出局部窄段，並保存每層熱態與冷態量測差異，避免只依供料清單驗收。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure compacted width and centerline by segment and compare delivery with transition height.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層長200 m、寬0.6 m、厚0.25 m，材料體積30 m³；若寬度局部少0.05 m持續20 m，缺量0.25 m³，不能靠別處超寬抵銷。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume lift length 200 m, width 0.6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 30 m³. A 0.05 m width deficit over 20 m loses 0.25 m³ and is not offset by excess elsewhere.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「薄層供料與寬度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Lift supply and core width\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層長200 m、寬0.6 m、厚0.25 m，材料體積30 m³。","相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。","老化後模數提高就表示心牆密封能力與延性必定一起提高。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume lift length 200 m, width 0.6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 30 m³.","Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain.","An ageing-related modulus increase necessarily improves both core sealing and ductility."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層長200 m、寬0.6 m、厚0.25 m，材料體積30 m³；若寬度局部少0.05 m持續20 m，缺量0.25 m³，不能靠別處超寬抵銷。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume lift length 200 m, width 0.6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 30 m³. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b236-v15-19","title":"薄層供料與寬度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Lift supply and core width: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「薄層供料與寬度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Lift supply and core width” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"逐段量測壓實後心牆寬度與中心線，將進料和過渡區高度對照；用位置化方量查出局部窄段，並保存每層熱態與冷態量測差異，避免只依供料清單驗收。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure compacted width and centerline by segment and compare delivery with transition height. Use spatial volume accounting to locate narrow sections, retaining warm and cooled dimensions rather than accepting the lift from delivery totals alone. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以薄層供料與寬度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。逐段量測壓實後心牆寬度與中心線，將進料和過渡區高度對照；用位置化方量查出局部窄段，並保存每層熱態與冷態量測差異，避免只依供料清單驗收。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for lift supply and core width, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure compacted width and centerline by segment and compare delivery with transition height. Use spatial volume accounting to locate narrow sections, retaining warm and cooled dimensions rather than accepting the lift from delivery totals alone.","failure":"注意干擾：材料側向擠入過渡料可使表面寬度看似足夠但有效核心變薄，局部冷料團也會破壞連續性。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Lateral intrusion into transition material can mask a thinner effective core, while cold clumps disrupt continuity. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"逐段量測壓實後心牆寬度與中心線，將進料和過渡區高度對照；用位置化方量查出局部窄段，並保存每層熱態與冷態量測差異，避免只依供料清單驗收。","textEn":"Measure compacted width and centerline by segment and compare delivery with transition height. Use spatial volume accounting to locate narrow sections, retaining warm and cooled dimensions rather than accepting the lift from delivery totals alone.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以薄層供料與寬度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。逐段量測壓實後心牆寬度與中心線，將進料和過渡區高度對照；用位置化方量查出局部窄段，並保存每層熱態與冷態量測差異，避免只依供料清單驗收。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for lift supply and core width, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure compacted width and centerline by segment and compare delivery with transition height. Use spatial volume accounting to locate narrow sections, retaining warm and cooled dimensions rather than accepting the lift from delivery totals alone.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「薄層供料與寬度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Lift supply and core width\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","逐段量測壓實後心牆寬度與中心線，將進料和過渡區高度對照；用位置化方量查出局部窄段，並保存每層熱態與冷態量測差異，避免只依供料清單驗收。","總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Measure compacted width and centerline by segment and compare delivery with transition height.","Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core."],"answer":1,"explanation":"逐段量測壓實後心牆寬度與中心線，將進料和過渡區高度對照；用位置化方量查出局部窄段，並保存每層熱態與冷態量測差異，避免只依供料清單驗收。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure compacted width and centerline by segment and compare delivery with transition height. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b236-v15-20","title":"薄層供料與寬度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Lift supply and core width: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「薄層供料與寬度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Lift supply and core width” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"材料側向擠入過渡料可使表面寬度看似足夠但有效核心變薄，局部冷料團也會破壞連續性。把整層平均寬度當最小厚度，會漏掉控制滲流的窄點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Lateral intrusion into transition material can mask a thinner effective core, while cold clumps disrupt continuity. Treating mean width as minimum thickness misses narrow sections controlling seepage performance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：把整層平均寬度當最小厚度，會漏掉控制滲流的窄點。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Treating mean width as minimum thickness misses narrow sections controlling seepage performance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"材料側向擠入過渡料可使表面寬度看似足夠但有效核心變薄，局部冷料團也會破壞連續性。把整層平均寬度當最小厚度，會漏掉控制滲流的窄點。","textEn":"Lateral intrusion into transition material can mask a thinner effective core, while cold clumps disrupt continuity. Treating mean width as minimum thickness misses narrow sections controlling seepage performance.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「薄層供料與寬度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Lift supply and core width\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。","材料側向擠入過渡料可使表面寬度看似足夠但有效核心變薄，局部冷料團也會破壞連續性。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Ductile asphalt material guarantees complete bonding at every construction interface.","Lateral intrusion into transition material can mask a thinner effective core, while cold clumps disrupt continuity."],"answer":2,"explanation":"材料側向擠入過渡料可使表面寬度看似足夠但有效核心變薄，局部冷料團也會破壞連續性。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Lateral intrusion into transition material can mask a thinner effective core, while cold clumps disrupt continuity. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b236-v15-21","title":"層間黏結與剪切：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Interlift bond and shear: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「層間黏結與剪切」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Interlift bond and shear” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"瀝青層之間的黏結受表面潔淨、熱歷程和壓實影響，整體材料延性不能補救未黏結界面。接縫試驗需保留載重方向與溫度條件。 假設接縫試體剪力峰值12 kN、面積0.02 m²，名義剪應力0.6 MPa；不含應力集中且只代表該溫度速率下試驗。 試體可能在完整材料先破壞而無法量得真正接縫能力，也可能因取芯熱損傷改變結果。若只報最大剪力不記錄破壞面，便無法判讀層間品質。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「層間黏結與剪切」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Asphalt interlift bonding depends on cleanliness, thermal history and compaction. Bulk ductility cannot repair an unbonded interface, and joint tests must preserve loading direction and temperature conditions. Assume joint specimen peak shear 12 kN over 0.02 m². Nominal shear stress is 0.6 MPa, excluding concentration and applying only at the tested temperature and rate. Failure in intact material may prevent measuring joint capacity, while coring heat can alter results. Reporting peak force without the failure surface leaves the interlift quality interpretation incomplete and potentially misleading. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Interlift bond and shear” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設接縫試體剪力峰值12 kN、面積0.02 m²，名義剪應力0.6 MPa；不含應力集中且只代表該溫度速率下試驗。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume joint specimen peak shear 12 kN over 0.02 m².","failure":"常見誤解：「瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Ductile asphalt material guarantees complete bonding at every construction interface.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「層間黏結與剪切」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Interlift bond and shear”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-21-k1","title":"層間黏結與剪切","titleEn":"Interlift bond and shear","text":"瀝青層之間的黏結受表面潔淨、熱歷程和壓實影響，整體材料延性不能補救未黏結界面。接縫試驗需保留載重方向與溫度條件。","textEn":"Asphalt interlift bonding depends on cleanliness, thermal history and compaction. Bulk ductility cannot repair an unbonded interface, and joint tests must preserve loading direction and temperature conditions.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Ductile asphalt material guarantees complete bonding at every construction interface. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「層間黏結與剪切」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Interlift bond and shear\" is correct?","options":["瀝青層之間的黏結受表面潔淨、熱歷程和壓實影響，整體材料延性不能補救未黏結界面。","瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。","只要平均接觸壓力大於水壓，接頭就不可能存在漏流。"],"optionsEn":["Asphalt interlift bonding depends on cleanliness, thermal history and compaction.","Ductile asphalt material guarantees complete bonding at every construction interface.","Mean contact pressure above water pressure makes leakage through the connection impossible."],"answer":0,"explanation":"瀝青層之間的黏結受表面潔淨、熱歷程和壓實影響，整體材料延性不能補救未黏結界面。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Asphalt interlift bonding depends on cleanliness, thermal history and compaction. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b236-v15-22","title":"層間黏結與剪切：定量估算","titleEn":"Interlift bond and shear: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「層間黏結與剪切」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Interlift bond and shear” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設接縫試體剪力峰值12 kN、面積0.02 m²，名義剪應力0.6 MPa；不含應力集中且只代表該溫度速率下試驗。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume joint specimen peak shear 12 kN over 0.02 m². Nominal shear stress is 0.6 MPa, excluding concentration and applying only at the tested temperature and rate. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把跨層芯樣與同層完整樣配對試驗，記錄破壞是在界面還是材料內；核對表面污染和溫度紀錄，再以滲透與顯微觀察確認剪力合格沒有掩蓋局部未黏結區。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Pair interface-crossing cores with intact specimens and record whether failure occurs at the joint or within material.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設接縫試體剪力峰值12 kN、面積0.02 m²，名義剪應力0.6 MPa；不含應力集中且只代表該溫度速率下試驗。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume joint specimen peak shear 12 kN over 0.02 m². Nominal shear stress is 0.6 MPa, excluding concentration and applying only at the tested temperature and rate.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「層間黏結與剪切」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Interlift bond and shear\", which statement holds?","options":["連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設接縫試體剪力峰值12 kN、面積0.02 m²，名義剪應力0.6 MPa；不含應力集中且只代表該溫度速率下試驗。","按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume joint specimen peak shear 12 kN over 0.02 m².","Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設接縫試體剪力峰值12 kN、面積0.02 m²，名義剪應力0.6 MPa；不含應力集中且只代表該溫度速率下試驗。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume joint specimen peak shear 12 kN over 0.02 m². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b236-v15-23","title":"層間黏結與剪切：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Interlift bond and shear: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「層間黏結與剪切」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Interlift bond and shear” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把跨層芯樣與同層完整樣配對試驗，記錄破壞是在界面還是材料內；核對表面污染和溫度紀錄，再以滲透與顯微觀察確認剪力合格沒有掩蓋局部未黏結區。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Pair interface-crossing cores with intact specimens and record whether failure occurs at the joint or within material. Check contamination and temperature records and use permeability and microscopy to identify local unbonded areas hidden by acceptable peak strength. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以層間黏結與剪切編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把跨層芯樣與同層完整樣配對試驗，記錄破壞是在界面還是材料內；核對表面污染和溫度紀錄，再以滲透與顯微觀察確認剪力合格沒有掩蓋局部未黏結區。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for interlift bond and shear, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Pair interface-crossing cores with intact specimens and record whether failure occurs at the joint or within material. Check contamination and temperature records and use permeability and microscopy to identify local unbonded areas hidden by acceptable peak strength.","failure":"注意干擾：試體可能在完整材料先破壞而無法量得真正接縫能力，也可能因取芯熱損傷改變結果。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Failure in intact material may prevent measuring joint capacity, while coring heat can alter results. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把跨層芯樣與同層完整樣配對試驗，記錄破壞是在界面還是材料內；核對表面污染和溫度紀錄，再以滲透與顯微觀察確認剪力合格沒有掩蓋局部未黏結區。","textEn":"Pair interface-crossing cores with intact specimens and record whether failure occurs at the joint or within material. Check contamination and temperature records and use permeability and microscopy to identify local unbonded areas hidden by acceptable peak strength.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以層間黏結與剪切編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把跨層芯樣與同層完整樣配對試驗，記錄破壞是在界面還是材料內；核對表面污染和溫度紀錄，再以滲透與顯微觀察確認剪力合格沒有掩蓋局部未黏結區。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for interlift bond and shear, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Pair interface-crossing cores with intact specimens and record whether failure occurs at the joint or within material. Check contamination and temperature records and use permeability and microscopy to identify local unbonded areas hidden by acceptable peak strength.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「層間黏結與剪切」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Interlift bond and shear\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。","把跨層芯樣與同層完整樣配對試驗，記錄破壞是在界面還是材料內；核對表面污染和溫度紀錄，再以滲透與顯微觀察確認剪力合格沒有掩蓋局部未黏結區。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions.","Pair interface-crossing cores with intact specimens and record whether failure occurs at the joint or within material."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把跨層芯樣與同層完整樣配對試驗，記錄破壞是在界面還是材料內；核對表面污染和溫度紀錄，再以滲透與顯微觀察確認剪力合格沒有掩蓋局部未黏結區。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Pair interface-crossing cores with intact specimens and record whether failure occurs at the joint or within material. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b236-v15-24","title":"層間黏結與剪切：失效診斷","titleEn":"Interlift bond and shear: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「層間黏結與剪切」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Interlift bond and shear” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"試體可能在完整材料先破壞而無法量得真正接縫能力，也可能因取芯熱損傷改變結果。若只報最大剪力不記錄破壞面，便無法判讀層間品質。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Failure in intact material may prevent measuring joint capacity, while coring heat can alter results. Reporting peak force without the failure surface leaves the interlift quality interpretation incomplete and potentially misleading. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若只報最大剪力不記錄破壞面，便無法判讀層間品質。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Reporting peak force without the failure surface leaves the interlift quality interpretation incomplete and potentially misleading.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Ductile asphalt material guarantees complete bonding at every construction interface.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"試體可能在完整材料先破壞而無法量得真正接縫能力，也可能因取芯熱損傷改變結果。若只報最大剪力不記錄破壞面，便無法判讀層間品質。","textEn":"Failure in intact material may prevent measuring joint capacity, while coring heat can alter results. Reporting peak force without the failure surface leaves the interlift quality interpretation incomplete and potentially misleading.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「層間黏結與剪切」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Interlift bond and shear\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["試體可能在完整材料先破壞而無法量得真正接縫能力，也可能因取芯熱損傷改變結果。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","只要平均接觸壓力大於水壓，接頭就不可能存在漏流。"],"optionsEn":["Failure in intact material may prevent measuring joint capacity, while coring heat can alter results.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Mean contact pressure above water pressure makes leakage through the connection impossible."],"answer":0,"explanation":"試體可能在完整材料先破壞而無法量得真正接縫能力，也可能因取芯熱損傷改變結果。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Failure in intact material may prevent measuring joint capacity, while coring heat can alter results. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b236-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「趾板接觸與有效壓力」與「過渡區剪應變相容」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Plinth contact and effective pressure\" and \"Transition-zone shear compatibility\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b236-v15-25","title":"趾板接觸與有效壓力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Plinth contact and effective pressure: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「趾板接觸與有效壓力」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Plinth contact and effective pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"心牆與混凝土趾板需要在變形下維持密封，接觸壓力和水壓之差影響張開傾向。幾何粗糙、黏結與黏彈行為使此差值只能作初步指標。 假設總接觸壓力300 kPa、接面水壓220 kPa，差80 kPa；若變形降低接觸壓力100 kPa，差為−20 kPa，不直接判定必然失效。 接觸壓力下降可能只在小區域發生，平均土壓計會漏掉；黏結損傷也可在仍受壓時形成優先通道。單一壓差不能代表接頭完整的密封狀態。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「趾板接觸與有效壓力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The core-plinth connection must remain sealed during deformation. Contact compression minus water pressure indicates opening tendency, but roughness, bond and viscoelastic behavior make it only a preliminary measure. Assume contact compression 300 kPa and interface water pressure 220 kPa, leaving eighty kPa. A hundred-kPa reduction gives −20 kPa, without directly declaring inevitable failure. Loss of compression can be localized and missed by averaged pressure measurements, while damaged bond can create paths even under compression. One pressure difference cannot establish the complete sealing condition of the connection. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Plinth contact and effective pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設總接觸壓力300 kPa、接面水壓220 kPa，差80 kPa；若變形降低接觸壓力100 kPa，差為−20 kPa，不直接判定必然失效。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume contact compression 300 kPa and interface water pressure 220 kPa, leaving eighty kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要平均接觸壓力大於水壓，接頭就不可能存在漏流。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Mean contact pressure above water pressure makes leakage through the connection impossible.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「趾板接觸與有效壓力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Plinth contact and effective pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-25-k1","title":"趾板接觸與有效壓力","titleEn":"Plinth contact and effective pressure","text":"心牆與混凝土趾板需要在變形下維持密封，接觸壓力和水壓之差影響張開傾向。幾何粗糙、黏結與黏彈行為使此差值只能作初步指標。","textEn":"The core-plinth connection must remain sealed during deformation. Contact compression minus water pressure indicates opening tendency, but roughness, bond and viscoelastic behavior make it only a preliminary measure.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要平均接觸壓力大於水壓，接頭就不可能存在漏流。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Mean contact pressure above water pressure makes leakage through the connection impossible. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「趾板接觸與有效壓力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Plinth contact and effective pressure\" is correct?","options":["只要平均接觸壓力大於水壓，接頭就不可能存在漏流。","心牆與混凝土趾板需要在變形下維持密封，接觸壓力和水壓之差影響張開傾向。","相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。"],"optionsEn":["Mean contact pressure above water pressure makes leakage through the connection impossible.","The core-plinth connection must remain sealed during deformation.","Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain."],"answer":1,"explanation":"心牆與混凝土趾板需要在變形下維持密封，接觸壓力和水壓之差影響張開傾向。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The core-plinth connection must remain sealed during deformation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b236-v15-26","title":"趾板接觸與有效壓力：定量估算","titleEn":"Plinth contact and effective pressure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「趾板接觸與有效壓力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Plinth contact and effective pressure” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設總接觸壓力300 kPa、接面水壓220 kPa，差80 kPa；若變形降低接觸壓力100 kPa，差為−20 kPa，不直接判定必然失效。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume contact compression 300 kPa and interface water pressure 220 kPa, leaving eighty kPa. A hundred-kPa reduction gives −20 kPa, without directly declaring inevitable failure. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對接面位移、壓力和漏流在同一時段的關係，檢查儀器是否代表實際接觸區；利用接頭專屬試驗比較不同溫度和剪移路徑，避免以一般瀝青試體代替接面。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare interface movement, pressure and leakage over the same period and verify instrument representativeness.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設總接觸壓力300 kPa、接面水壓220 kPa，差80 kPa；若變形降低接觸壓力100 kPa，差為−20 kPa，不直接判定必然失效。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume contact compression 300 kPa and interface water pressure 220 kPa, leaving eighty kPa. A hundred-kPa reduction gives −20 kPa, without directly declaring inevitable failure.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「趾板接觸與有效壓力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Plinth contact and effective pressure\", which statement holds?","options":["老化後模數提高就表示心牆密封能力與延性必定一起提高。","總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設總接觸壓力300 kPa、接面水壓220 kPa，差80 kPa。"],"optionsEn":["An ageing-related modulus increase necessarily improves both core sealing and ductility.","Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume contact compression 300 kPa and interface water pressure 220 kPa, leaving eighty kPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設總接觸壓力300 kPa、接面水壓220 kPa，差80 kPa；若變形降低接觸壓力100 kPa，差為−20 kPa，不直接判定必然失效。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume contact compression 300 kPa and interface water pressure 220 kPa, leaving eighty kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b236-v15-27","title":"趾板接觸與有效壓力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Plinth contact and effective pressure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「趾板接觸與有效壓力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Plinth contact and effective pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對接面位移、壓力和漏流在同一時段的關係，檢查儀器是否代表實際接觸區；利用接頭專屬試驗比較不同溫度和剪移路徑，避免以一般瀝青試體代替接面。檢查接觸面水壓是否均勻。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare interface movement, pressure and leakage over the same period and verify instrument representativeness. Use connection-specific tests across temperatures and shear paths instead of substituting generic asphalt specimens for the actual contact geometry. Check whether interface water pressure is spatially uniform. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以趾板接觸與有效壓力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對接面位移、壓力和漏流在同一時段的關係，檢查儀器是否代表實際接觸區；利用接頭專屬試驗比較不同溫度和剪移路徑，避免以一般瀝青試體代替接面。檢查接觸面水壓是否均勻。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for plinth contact and effective pressure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare interface movement, pressure and leakage over the same period and verify instrument representativeness. Use connection-specific tests across temperatures and shear paths instead of substituting generic asphalt specimens for the actual contact geometry. Check whether interface water pressure is spatially uniform.","failure":"注意干擾：接觸壓力下降可能只在小區域發生，平均土壓計會漏掉；黏結損傷也可在仍受壓時形成優先通道。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Loss of compression can be localized and missed by averaged pressure measurements, while damaged bond can create paths even under compression. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對接面位移、壓力和漏流在同一時段的關係，檢查儀器是否代表實際接觸區；利用接頭專屬試驗比較不同溫度和剪移路徑，避免以一般瀝青試體代替接面。檢查接觸面水壓是否均勻。","textEn":"Compare interface movement, pressure and leakage over the same period and verify instrument representativeness. Use connection-specific tests across temperatures and shear paths instead of substituting generic asphalt specimens for the actual contact geometry. Check whether interface water pressure is spatially uniform.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以趾板接觸與有效壓力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對接面位移、壓力和漏流在同一時段的關係，檢查儀器是否代表實際接觸區；利用接頭專屬試驗比較不同溫度和剪移路徑，避免以一般瀝青試體代替接面。檢查接觸面水壓是否均勻。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for plinth contact and effective pressure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare interface movement, pressure and leakage over the same period and verify instrument representativeness. Use connection-specific tests across temperatures and shear paths instead of substituting generic asphalt specimens for the actual contact geometry. Check whether interface water pressure is spatially uniform.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「趾板接觸與有效壓力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Plinth contact and effective pressure\"?","options":["核對接面位移、壓力和漏流在同一時段的關係，檢查儀器是否代表實際接觸區；利用接頭專屬試驗比較不同溫度和剪移路徑，避免以一般瀝青試體代替接面。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。"],"optionsEn":["Compare interface movement, pressure and leakage over the same period and verify instrument representativeness.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對接面位移、壓力和漏流在同一時段的關係，檢查儀器是否代表實際接觸區；利用接頭專屬試驗比較不同溫度和剪移路徑，避免以一般瀝青試體代替接面。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare interface movement, pressure and leakage over the same period and verify instrument representativeness. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b236-v15-28","title":"趾板接觸與有效壓力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Plinth contact and effective pressure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「趾板接觸與有效壓力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Plinth contact and effective pressure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"接觸壓力下降可能只在小區域發生，平均土壓計會漏掉；黏結損傷也可在仍受壓時形成優先通道。單一壓差不能代表接頭完整的密封狀態。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Loss of compression can be localized and missed by averaged pressure measurements, while damaged bond can create paths even under compression. One pressure difference cannot establish the complete sealing condition of the connection. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：單一壓差不能代表接頭完整的密封狀態。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: One pressure difference cannot establish the complete sealing condition of the connection.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要平均接觸壓力大於水壓，接頭就不可能存在漏流。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Mean contact pressure above water pressure makes leakage through the connection impossible.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"接觸壓力下降可能只在小區域發生，平均土壓計會漏掉；黏結損傷也可在仍受壓時形成優先通道。單一壓差不能代表接頭完整的密封狀態。","textEn":"Loss of compression can be localized and missed by averaged pressure measurements, while damaged bond can create paths even under compression. One pressure difference cannot establish the complete sealing condition of the connection.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「趾板接觸與有效壓力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Plinth contact and effective pressure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","接觸壓力下降可能只在小區域發生，平均土壓計會漏掉；黏結損傷也可在仍受壓時形成優先通道。","相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Loss of compression can be localized and missed by averaged pressure measurements, while damaged bond can create paths even under compression.","Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain."],"answer":1,"explanation":"接觸壓力下降可能只在小區域發生，平均土壓計會漏掉；黏結損傷也可在仍受壓時形成優先通道。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Loss of compression can be localized and missed by averaged pressure measurements, while damaged bond can create paths even under compression. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b236-v15-29","title":"過渡區剪應變相容：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Transition-zone shear compatibility: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「過渡區剪應變相容」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Transition-zone shear compatibility” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"心牆和相鄰粗粒材料沉降不同，界面會傳遞剪力並形成局部剪應變。相對位移除以代表厚度只是幾何估算，真正變形可能集中在更薄區域。 假設相對位移4 mm分布於0.5 m厚區，工程剪應變γ=0.004/0.5=0.008，即0.8%；均勻剪切假設，非容許值。 把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。若沒有位移分布資料，不能把任選厚度的計算稱作實測材料應變。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「過渡區剪應變相容」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Differential settlement between core and coarse transition material transfers shear. Relative displacement divided by representative thickness is only geometric; actual deformation may localize within a much thinner band. Assume relative movement 4 mm distributed across thickness 0.5 m. Engineering shear strain is 0.008, or 0.8 percent, under uniform shear and not an allowable value. Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative. Without a displacement profile, the selected-width calculation is not a measured material strain. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Transition-zone shear compatibility” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相對位移4 mm分布於0.5 m厚區，工程剪應變γ=0.004/0.5=0.008，即0.8%；均勻剪切假設，非容許值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume relative movement 4 mm distributed across thickness 0.5 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「過渡區剪應變相容」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Transition-zone shear compatibility”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-29-k1","title":"過渡區剪應變相容","titleEn":"Transition-zone shear compatibility","text":"心牆和相鄰粗粒材料沉降不同，界面會傳遞剪力並形成局部剪應變。相對位移除以代表厚度只是幾何估算，真正變形可能集中在更薄區域。","textEn":"Differential settlement between core and coarse transition material transfers shear. Relative displacement divided by representative thickness is only geometric; actual deformation may localize within a much thinner band.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「過渡區剪應變相容」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Transition-zone shear compatibility\" is correct?","options":["相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。","連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。","心牆和相鄰粗粒材料沉降不同，界面會傳遞剪力並形成局部剪應變。"],"optionsEn":["Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain.","Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free.","Differential settlement between core and coarse transition material transfers shear."],"answer":2,"explanation":"心牆和相鄰粗粒材料沉降不同，界面會傳遞剪力並形成局部剪應變。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Differential settlement between core and coarse transition material transfers shear. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b236-v15-30","title":"過渡區剪應變相容：定量估算","titleEn":"Transition-zone shear compatibility: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「過渡區剪應變相容」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Transition-zone shear compatibility” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相對位移4 mm分布於0.5 m厚區，工程剪應變γ=0.004/0.5=0.008，即0.8%；均勻剪切假設，非容許值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume relative movement 4 mm distributed across thickness 0.5 m. Engineering shear strain is 0.008, or 0.8 percent, under uniform shear and not an allowable value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：設置跨界面多個位移點辨認變形分布，對照過渡料粒徑與心牆溫度；將平均剪應變和局部最大值分開，並用相同尺度的試驗檢查是否出現界面滑移。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相對位移4 mm分布於0.5 m厚區，工程剪應變γ=0.004/0.5=0.008，即0.8%；均勻剪切假設，非容許值。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume relative movement 4 mm distributed across thickness 0.5 m. Engineering shear strain is 0.008, or 0.8 percent, under uniform shear and not an allowable value.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「過渡區剪應變相容」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Transition-zone shear compatibility\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相對位移4 mm分布於0.5 m厚區，工程剪應變γ=0.004/0.5=0.008，即0.8%；均勻剪切假設，非容許值。","按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。","短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume relative movement 4 mm distributed across thickness 0.5 m.","Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical.","A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相對位移4 mm分布於0.5 m厚區，工程剪應變γ=0.004/0.5=0.008，即0.8%；均勻剪切假設，非容許值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume relative movement 4 mm distributed across thickness 0.5 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b236-v15-31","title":"過渡區剪應變相容：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Transition-zone shear compatibility: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「過渡區剪應變相容」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Transition-zone shear compatibility” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"設置跨界面多個位移點辨認變形分布，對照過渡料粒徑與心牆溫度；將平均剪應變和局部最大值分開，並用相同尺度的試驗檢查是否出現界面滑移。固定標記間的量測長度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature. Separate mean and local maximum shear and test comparable scales for evidence of interface slip or localization. Keep the displacement gauge length explicitly defined. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以過渡區剪應變相容編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。設置跨界面多個位移點辨認變形分布，對照過渡料粒徑與心牆溫度；將平均剪應變和局部最大值分開，並用相同尺度的試驗檢查是否出現界面滑移。固定標記間的量測長度。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for transition-zone shear compatibility, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature. Separate mean and local maximum shear and test comparable scales for evidence of interface slip or localization. Keep the displacement gauge length explicitly defined.","failure":"注意干擾：把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"設置跨界面多個位移點辨認變形分布，對照過渡料粒徑與心牆溫度；將平均剪應變和局部最大值分開，並用相同尺度的試驗檢查是否出現界面滑移。固定標記間的量測長度。","textEn":"Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature. Separate mean and local maximum shear and test comparable scales for evidence of interface slip or localization. Keep the displacement gauge length explicitly defined.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以過渡區剪應變相容編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。設置跨界面多個位移點辨認變形分布，對照過渡料粒徑與心牆溫度；將平均剪應變和局部最大值分開，並用相同尺度的試驗檢查是否出現界面滑移。固定標記間的量測長度。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for transition-zone shear compatibility, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature. Separate mean and local maximum shear and test comparable scales for evidence of interface slip or localization. Keep the displacement gauge length explicitly defined.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「過渡區剪應變相容」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Transition-zone shear compatibility\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","設置跨界面多個位移點辨認變形分布，對照過渡料粒徑與心牆溫度；將平均剪應變和局部最大值分開，並用相同尺度的試驗檢查是否出現界面滑移。","其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature.","Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width."],"answer":1,"explanation":"設置跨界面多個位移點辨認變形分布，對照過渡料粒徑與心牆溫度；將平均剪應變和局部最大值分開，並用相同尺度的試驗檢查是否出現界面滑移。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b236-v15-32","title":"過渡區剪應變相容：失效診斷","titleEn":"Transition-zone shear compatibility: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「過渡區剪應變相容」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Transition-zone shear compatibility” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。若沒有位移分布資料，不能把任選厚度的計算稱作實測材料應變。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative. Without a displacement profile, the selected-width calculation is not a measured material strain. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若沒有位移分布資料，不能把任選厚度的計算稱作實測材料應變。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Without a displacement profile, the selected-width calculation is not a measured material strain.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。若沒有位移分布資料，不能把任選厚度的計算稱作實測材料應變。","textEn":"Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative. Without a displacement profile, the selected-width calculation is not a measured material strain.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「過渡區剪應變相容」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Transition-zone shear compatibility\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。","把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free.","Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b236-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「品質抽樣漏檢機率」與「材料老化與保留試樣」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Sampling and missed defects\" and \"Material ageing and retained specimens\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b236-v15-33","title":"品質抽樣漏檢機率：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Sampling and missed defects: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「品質抽樣漏檢機率」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sampling and missed defects” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"抽樣能提供品質證據但不能證明每處完美，漏檢機率取決於缺陷分布與樣本獨立性。沿同一路徑取樣可能高度相關，不能用樣本數誇大信心。 假設每個獨立樣本遇缺陷機率0.05，取20個仍全未遇到的機率0.95²⁰=0.35849；僅獨立均勻假設，不是抽樣計畫建議。 連續缺陷帶可被集中取樣完全避開，零缺陷樣本不等於零缺陷工程。若檢測方法本身靈敏度不足，增加相同測試次數也可能無法發現指定缺陷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「品質抽樣漏檢機率」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Sampling supplies evidence rather than proof of perfection. Miss probability depends on defect distribution and independence, while samples along one track can be highly correlated and overstate confidence. Assume independent defect probability 0.05 per sample. Twenty samples all miss defects with probability 0.95²⁰=0.35849, under uniform independence and not as a sampling-plan recommendation. Clustered samples can entirely avoid a continuous defect band, so zero observed defects do not establish zero actual defects. Limited detection sensitivity may persist even after repeating the same test many times. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sampling and missed defects” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每個獨立樣本遇缺陷機率0.05，取20個仍全未遇到的機率0.95²⁰=0.35849；僅獨立均勻假設，不是抽樣計畫建議。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume independent defect probability 0.05 per sample.","failure":"常見誤解：「連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「品質抽樣漏檢機率」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Sampling and missed defects”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-33-k1","title":"品質抽樣漏檢機率","titleEn":"Sampling and missed defects","text":"抽樣能提供品質證據但不能證明每處完美，漏檢機率取決於缺陷分布與樣本獨立性。沿同一路徑取樣可能高度相關，不能用樣本數誇大信心。","textEn":"Sampling supplies evidence rather than proof of perfection. Miss probability depends on defect distribution and independence, while samples along one track can be highly correlated and overstate confidence.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「品質抽樣漏檢機率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Sampling and missed defects\" is correct?","options":["抽樣能提供品質證據但不能證明每處完美，漏檢機率取決於缺陷分布與樣本獨立性。","連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。","老化後模數提高就表示心牆密封能力與延性必定一起提高。"],"optionsEn":["Sampling supplies evidence rather than proof of perfection.","Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free.","An ageing-related modulus increase necessarily improves both core sealing and ductility."],"answer":0,"explanation":"抽樣能提供品質證據但不能證明每處完美，漏檢機率取決於缺陷分布與樣本獨立性。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Sampling supplies evidence rather than proof of perfection. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b236-v15-34","title":"品質抽樣漏檢機率：定量估算","titleEn":"Sampling and missed defects: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「品質抽樣漏檢機率」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sampling and missed defects” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每個獨立樣本遇缺陷機率0.05，取20個仍全未遇到的機率0.95²⁰=0.35849；僅獨立均勻假設，不是抽樣計畫建議。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume independent defect probability 0.05 per sample. Twenty samples all miss defects with probability 0.95²⁰=0.35849, under uniform independence and not as a sampling-plan recommendation. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把樣本分布畫到每層平面，核對是否涵蓋接縫、窄段和熱歷程異常區；將隨機樣本與針對性缺陷檢查分開統計，並說明空間相關會如何降低有效樣本數。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Map sample coverage on every lift and include joints, narrow sections and thermal anomalies.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每個獨立樣本遇缺陷機率0.05，取20個仍全未遇到的機率0.95²⁰=0.35849；僅獨立均勻假設，不是抽樣計畫建議。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume independent defect probability 0.05 per sample. Twenty samples all miss defects with probability 0.95²⁰=0.35849, under uniform independence and not as a sampling-plan recommendation.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「品質抽樣漏檢機率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Sampling and missed defects\", which statement holds?","options":["總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每個獨立樣本遇缺陷機率0.05，取20個仍全未遇到的機率0.95²⁰=0.35849；僅獨立均勻假設，不是抽樣計畫建議。","自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。"],"optionsEn":["Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume independent defect probability 0.05 per sample.","Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每個獨立樣本遇缺陷機率0.05，取20個仍全未遇到的機率0.95²⁰=0.35849；僅獨立均勻假設，不是抽樣計畫建議。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume independent defect probability 0.05 per sample. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b236-v15-35","title":"品質抽樣漏檢機率：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Sampling and missed defects: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「品質抽樣漏檢機率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Sampling and missed defects” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把樣本分布畫到每層平面，核對是否涵蓋接縫、窄段和熱歷程異常區；將隨機樣本與針對性缺陷檢查分開統計，並說明空間相關會如何降低有效樣本數。另畫空間聚集分布圖。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Map sample coverage on every lift and include joints, narrow sections and thermal anomalies. Analyze random sampling separately from targeted defect checks and explain how spatial correlation reduces the effective number of independent observations. Also map spatial clustering of possible defects. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以品質抽樣漏檢機率編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把樣本分布畫到每層平面，核對是否涵蓋接縫、窄段和熱歷程異常區；將隨機樣本與針對性缺陷檢查分開統計，並說明空間相關會如何降低有效樣本數。另畫空間聚集分布圖。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for sampling and missed defects, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Map sample coverage on every lift and include joints, narrow sections and thermal anomalies. Analyze random sampling separately from targeted defect checks and explain how spatial correlation reduces the effective number of independent observations. Also map spatial clustering of possible defects.","failure":"注意干擾：連續缺陷帶可被集中取樣完全避開，零缺陷樣本不等於零缺陷工程。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Clustered samples can entirely avoid a continuous defect band, so zero observed defects do not establish zero actual defects. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把樣本分布畫到每層平面，核對是否涵蓋接縫、窄段和熱歷程異常區；將隨機樣本與針對性缺陷檢查分開統計，並說明空間相關會如何降低有效樣本數。另畫空間聚集分布圖。","textEn":"Map sample coverage on every lift and include joints, narrow sections and thermal anomalies. Analyze random sampling separately from targeted defect checks and explain how spatial correlation reduces the effective number of independent observations. Also map spatial clustering of possible defects.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以品質抽樣漏檢機率編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把樣本分布畫到每層平面，核對是否涵蓋接縫、窄段和熱歷程異常區；將隨機樣本與針對性缺陷檢查分開統計，並說明空間相關會如何降低有效樣本數。另畫空間聚集分布圖。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for sampling and missed defects, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Map sample coverage on every lift and include joints, narrow sections and thermal anomalies. Analyze random sampling separately from targeted defect checks and explain how spatial correlation reduces the effective number of independent observations. Also map spatial clustering of possible defects.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「品質抽樣漏檢機率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Sampling and missed defects\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。","把樣本分布畫到每層平面，核對是否涵蓋接縫、窄段和熱歷程異常區；將隨機樣本與針對性缺陷檢查分開統計，並說明空間相關會如何降低有效樣本數。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Ductile asphalt material guarantees complete bonding at every construction interface.","Map sample coverage on every lift and include joints, narrow sections and thermal anomalies."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把樣本分布畫到每層平面，核對是否涵蓋接縫、窄段和熱歷程異常區；將隨機樣本與針對性缺陷檢查分開統計，並說明空間相關會如何降低有效樣本數。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Map sample coverage on every lift and include joints, narrow sections and thermal anomalies. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b236-v15-36","title":"品質抽樣漏檢機率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Sampling and missed defects: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「品質抽樣漏檢機率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sampling and missed defects” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"連續缺陷帶可被集中取樣完全避開，零缺陷樣本不等於零缺陷工程。若檢測方法本身靈敏度不足，增加相同測試次數也可能無法發現指定缺陷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Clustered samples can entirely avoid a continuous defect band, so zero observed defects do not establish zero actual defects. Limited detection sensitivity may persist even after repeating the same test many times. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若檢測方法本身靈敏度不足，增加相同測試次數也可能無法發現指定缺陷。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Limited detection sensitivity may persist even after repeating the same test many times.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"連續缺陷帶可被集中取樣完全避開，零缺陷樣本不等於零缺陷工程。若檢測方法本身靈敏度不足，增加相同測試次數也可能無法發現指定缺陷。","textEn":"Clustered samples can entirely avoid a continuous defect band, so zero observed defects do not establish zero actual defects. Limited detection sensitivity may persist even after repeating the same test many times.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「品質抽樣漏檢機率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Sampling and missed defects\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["連續缺陷帶可被集中取樣完全避開，零缺陷樣本不等於零缺陷工程。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","老化後模數提高就表示心牆密封能力與延性必定一起提高。"],"optionsEn":["Clustered samples can entirely avoid a continuous defect band, so zero observed defects do not establish zero actual defects.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","An ageing-related modulus increase necessarily improves both core sealing and ductility."],"answer":0,"explanation":"連續缺陷帶可被集中取樣完全避開，零缺陷樣本不等於零缺陷工程。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Clustered samples can entirely avoid a continuous defect band, so zero observed defects do not establish zero actual defects. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b236-v15-37","title":"材料老化與保留試樣：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Material ageing and retained specimens: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「材料老化與保留試樣」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Material ageing and retained specimens” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"瀝青材料隨熱氧化與時間改變，硬化可能提高短時剛度卻降低延性。比較需使用相同試驗溫度和速率，不能把較高強度自動解讀為更好密封能力。 假設相同試驗條件下模數由120升到180 MPa，剛度比1.5；同時破壞應變由0.04降0.025，降低37.5%，不代表真實老化速率。 保留試樣的氧氣暴露可能與深埋心牆不同，不能直接把其老化年限當現地壽命。若只檢查峰值強度，延性降低與界面脆化可能被視為性能改善而漏判。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「材料老化與保留試樣」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Asphalt changes with thermal oxidation and time. Hardening can raise short-term stiffness while reducing ductility, requiring comparisons at equal temperature and rate rather than treating higher strength as automatically better sealing. Assume modulus rises from 120 to 180 MPa under matched tests, a ratio 1.5, while failure strain falls from 0.04 to 0.025, a 37.5 percent reduction, not an actual ageing rate. Retained specimens may see different oxygen exposure from a buried core, preventing direct conversion to service life. Peak strength alone can make reduced ductility and interface embrittlement appear to be improved performance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Material ageing and retained specimens” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相同試驗條件下模數由120升到180 MPa，剛度比1.5；同時破壞應變由0.04降0.025，降低37.5%，不代表真實老化速率。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume modulus rises from 120 to 180 MPa under matched tests, a ratio 1.5, while failure strain falls from 0.04 to 0.025, a 37.5 percent reduction, not an actual ageing rate.","failure":"常見誤解：「老化後模數提高就表示心牆密封能力與延性必定一起提高。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An ageing-related modulus increase necessarily improves both core sealing and ductility.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「材料老化與保留試樣」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Material ageing and retained specimens”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-37-k1","title":"材料老化與保留試樣","titleEn":"Material ageing and retained specimens","text":"瀝青材料隨熱氧化與時間改變，硬化可能提高短時剛度卻降低延性。比較需使用相同試驗溫度和速率，不能把較高強度自動解讀為更好密封能力。","textEn":"Asphalt changes with thermal oxidation and time. Hardening can raise short-term stiffness while reducing ductility, requiring comparisons at equal temperature and rate rather than treating higher strength as automatically better sealing.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：老化後模數提高就表示心牆密封能力與延性必定一起提高。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An ageing-related modulus increase necessarily improves both core sealing and ductility. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「材料老化與保留試樣」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Material ageing and retained specimens\" is correct?","options":["老化後模數提高就表示心牆密封能力與延性必定一起提高。","瀝青材料隨熱氧化與時間改變，硬化可能提高短時剛度卻降低延性。","按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["An ageing-related modulus increase necessarily improves both core sealing and ductility.","Asphalt changes with thermal oxidation and time.","Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical."],"answer":1,"explanation":"瀝青材料隨熱氧化與時間改變，硬化可能提高短時剛度卻降低延性。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Asphalt changes with thermal oxidation and time. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b236-v15-38","title":"材料老化與保留試樣：定量估算","titleEn":"Material ageing and retained specimens: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「材料老化與保留試樣」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Material ageing and retained specimens” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相同試驗條件下模數由120升到180 MPa，剛度比1.5；同時破壞應變由0.04降0.025，降低37.5%，不代表真實老化速率。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume modulus rises from 120 to 180 MPa under matched tests, a ratio 1.5, while failure strain falls from 0.04 to 0.025, a 37.5 percent reduction, not an actual ageing rate. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以保留試樣和取芯建立同條件比較，核對儲存環境、試驗溫度和載重速率；同時報告剛度、延性與滲透，並檢查差異來自材料老化還是不同取樣位置與壓實程度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare retained and field-cored specimens under matched conditions, checking storage, test temperature and loading rate.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相同試驗條件下模數由120升到180 MPa，剛度比1.5；同時破壞應變由0.04降0.025，降低37.5%，不代表真實老化速率。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume modulus rises from 120 to 180 MPa under matched tests, a ratio 1.5, while failure strain falls from 0.04 to 0.025, a 37.5 percent reduction, not an actual ageing rate.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「材料老化與保留試樣」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Material ageing and retained specimens\", which statement holds?","options":["短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。","其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相同試驗條件下模數由120升到180 MPa，剛度比1.5。"],"optionsEn":["A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions.","Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume modulus rises from 120 to 180 MPa under matched tests, a ratio 1.5, while failure strain falls from 0.04 to 0.025, a 37.5 percent reduction, not an actual ageing rate."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相同試驗條件下模數由120升到180 MPa，剛度比1.5；同時破壞應變由0.04降0.025，降低37.5%，不代表真實老化速率。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume modulus rises from 120 to 180 MPa under matched tests, a ratio 1.5, while failure strain falls from 0.04 to 0.025, a 37.5 percent reduction, not an actual ageing rate. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b236-v15-39","title":"材料老化與保留試樣：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Material ageing and retained specimens: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「材料老化與保留試樣」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Material ageing and retained specimens” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以保留試樣和取芯建立同條件比較，核對儲存環境、試驗溫度和載重速率；同時報告剛度、延性與滲透，並檢查差異來自材料老化還是不同取樣位置與壓實程度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare retained and field-cored specimens under matched conditions, checking storage, test temperature and loading rate. Report stiffness, ductility and permeability together and distinguish ageing from different sample locations or compaction levels in the dam. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以材料老化與保留試樣編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以保留試樣和取芯建立同條件比較，核對儲存環境、試驗溫度和載重速率；同時報告剛度、延性與滲透，並檢查差異來自材料老化還是不同取樣位置與壓實程度。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for material ageing and retained specimens, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare retained and field-cored specimens under matched conditions, checking storage, test temperature and loading rate. Report stiffness, ductility and permeability together and distinguish ageing from different sample locations or compaction levels in the dam.","failure":"注意干擾：保留試樣的氧氣暴露可能與深埋心牆不同，不能直接把其老化年限當現地壽命。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Retained specimens may see different oxygen exposure from a buried core, preventing direct conversion to service life. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以保留試樣和取芯建立同條件比較，核對儲存環境、試驗溫度和載重速率；同時報告剛度、延性與滲透，並檢查差異來自材料老化還是不同取樣位置與壓實程度。","textEn":"Compare retained and field-cored specimens under matched conditions, checking storage, test temperature and loading rate. Report stiffness, ductility and permeability together and distinguish ageing from different sample locations or compaction levels in the dam.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以材料老化與保留試樣編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以保留試樣和取芯建立同條件比較，核對儲存環境、試驗溫度和載重速率；同時報告剛度、延性與滲透，並檢查差異來自材料老化還是不同取樣位置與壓實程度。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for material ageing and retained specimens, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare retained and field-cored specimens under matched conditions, checking storage, test temperature and loading rate. Report stiffness, ductility and permeability together and distinguish ageing from different sample locations or compaction levels in the dam.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「材料老化與保留試樣」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Material ageing and retained specimens\"?","options":["以保留試樣和取芯建立同條件比較，核對儲存環境、試驗溫度和載重速率；同時報告剛度、延性與滲透，並檢查差異來自材料老化還是不同取樣位置與壓實程度。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要平均接觸壓力大於水壓，接頭就不可能存在漏流。"],"optionsEn":["Compare retained and field-cored specimens under matched conditions, checking storage, test temperature and loading rate.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Mean contact pressure above water pressure makes leakage through the connection impossible."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以保留試樣和取芯建立同條件比較，核對儲存環境、試驗溫度和載重速率；同時報告剛度、延性與滲透，並檢查差異來自材料老化還是不同取樣位置與壓實程度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare retained and field-cored specimens under matched conditions, checking storage, test temperature and loading rate. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b236-v15-40","title":"材料老化與保留試樣：失效診斷","titleEn":"Material ageing and retained specimens: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"prerequisiteIds":["b236-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「材料老化與保留試樣」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Material ageing and retained specimens” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"保留試樣的氧氣暴露可能與深埋心牆不同，不能直接把其老化年限當現地壽命。若只檢查峰值強度，延性降低與界面脆化可能被視為性能改善而漏判。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Retained specimens may see different oxygen exposure from a buried core, preventing direct conversion to service life. Peak strength alone can make reduced ductility and interface embrittlement appear to be improved performance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若只檢查峰值強度，延性降低與界面脆化可能被視為性能改善而漏判。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Peak strength alone can make reduced ductility and interface embrittlement appear to be improved performance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「老化後模數提高就表示心牆密封能力與延性必定一起提高。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An ageing-related modulus increase necessarily improves both core sealing and ductility.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b236-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"保留試樣的氧氣暴露可能與深埋心牆不同，不能直接把其老化年限當現地壽命。若只檢查峰值強度，延性降低與界面脆化可能被視為性能改善而漏判。","textEn":"Retained specimens may see different oxygen exposure from a buried core, preventing direct conversion to service life. Peak strength alone can make reduced ductility and interface embrittlement appear to be improved performance.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]},{"id":"b236-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「材料老化與保留試樣」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Material ageing and retained specimens\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","保留試樣的氧氣暴露可能與深埋心牆不同，不能直接把其老化年限當現地壽命。","按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Retained specimens may see different oxygen exposure from a buried core, preventing direct conversion to service life.","Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical."],"answer":1,"explanation":"保留試樣的氧氣暴露可能與深埋心牆不同，不能直接把其老化年限當現地壽命。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Retained specimens may see different oxygen exposure from a buried core, preventing direct conversion to service life. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-asphalt-quxue","v15s-asphalt-rate","v15s-asphalt-model","v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
